# Prisma client generated into `@luke/db` by `prisma generate` (root `postinstall`).
# Source, not build output, but derived from `packages/db/prisma/*.prisma`
# (multi-file schema) and rewritten on every generate — committing it would be
# a second copy of the schema that reviews as 87 files of noise.
packages/db/src/generated/
